{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-ci-strategies","title":"测试策略与持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/engineering/testing-ci-strategies","wordCount":533,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试策略与持续集成\">测试策略与持续集成</h1><p>KMP 项目的测试面临独特挑战：同一份逻辑需要在 JVM、Native（iOS Simulator）和 Wasm 三个运行时上验证正确性；iOS 测试需要 macOS 构建机和模拟器；构建时间随平台数量线性增长。本篇覆盖从测试金字塔设计到 CI/CD 流水线搭建的完整策略，帮助你建立可维护、快速反馈的多平台质量保障体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>KMP 的测试策略核心原则是&quot;在最高共享层验证逻辑，在平台层验证集成&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 测试金字塔&#10;        A[commonTest 单元测试 80%] --&gt; B[平台集成测试 15%]&#10;        B --&gt; C[UI 测试 E2E 5%]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 运行环境&#10;        A --&gt; D[JVM 快速]&#10;        A --&gt; E[iOS Simulator]&#10;        A --&gt; F[Wasm 浏览器]&#10;        B --&gt; G[Android Instrumented]&#10;        B --&gt; H[iOS XCTest]&#10;        C --&gt; I[Compose UI Test]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 测试金字塔\n        A[commonTest 单元测试 80%] --&gt; B[平台集成测试 15%]\n        B --&gt; C[UI 测试 E2E 5%]\n    end\n    subgraph 运行环境\n        A --&gt; D[JVM 快速]\n        A --&gt; E[iOS Simulator]\n        A --&gt; F[Wasm 浏览器]\n        B --&gt; G[Android Instrumented]\n        B --&gt; H[iOS XCTest]\n        C --&gt; I[Compose UI Test]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试层级</th>\n<th>源集</th>\n<th>运行速度</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享单元测试</td>\n<td><code>commonTest</code></td>\n<td>快（JVM 秒级）</td>\n<td>业务逻辑、领域模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台单元测试</td>\n<td><code>androidTest</code>/<code>iosTest</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>平台特定实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td><code>androidInstrumentedTest</code></td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>系统集成、数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 测试</td>\n<td>Compose UI Test</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>用户交互流程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"commontest-编写模式\">commonTest 编写模式</h2><p><code>commonTest</code> 中的测试使用 <code>kotlin-test</code> 框架，在所有目标平台上运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest&#10;class UserRepositoryTest {&#10;    private val fakeApi = FakeUserApi()&#10;    private val fakeDao = FakeUserDao()&#10;    private val repository = UserRepository(fakeApi, fakeDao)&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun getUser_withCachedData_returnsLocalFirst() = runTest {&#10;        // Arrange&#10;        fakeDao.insert(UserEntity(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Cached Alice&quot;, &quot;a@b.com&quot;, 0))&#10;        fakeApi.respondWith(UserResponse(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Fresh Alice&quot;, &quot;a@b.com&quot;, &quot;2026-01-01&quot;))&#10;&#10;        // Act&#10;        val results = repository.observeUser(&quot;1&quot;).take(2).toList()&#10;&#10;        // Assert&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;Cached Alice&quot;, results[0].name)  // 本地缓存先到&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;Fresh Alice&quot;, results[1].name)    // 网络刷新后更新&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun getUser_withNetworkError_returnsCachedFallback() = runTest {&#10;        fakeDao.insert(UserEntity(&quot;1&quot;, &quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;a@b.com&quot;, 0))&#10;        fakeApi.simulateError(NetworkError.Connectivity(IOException(&quot;No network&quot;)))&#10;&#10;        val results = repository.observeUser(&quot;1&quot;).take(1).toList()&#10;&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;Alice&quot;, results[0].name)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserRepositoryTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeApi = FakeUserApi()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val fakeDao = FakeUserDao()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository = UserRepository(fakeApi, fakeDao)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getUser_withCachedData_returnsLocalFirst() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Arrange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeDao.insert(UserEntity(\"1\", \"Cached Alice\", \"a@b.com\", 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeApi.respondWith(UserResponse(\"1\", \"Fresh Alice\", \"a@b.com\", \"2026-01-01\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Act</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val results = repository.observeUser(\"1\").take(2).toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Assert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"Cached Alice\", results[0].name)  // 本地缓存先到</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"Fresh Alice\", results[1].name)    // 网络刷新后更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getUser_withNetworkError_returnsCachedFallback() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeDao.insert(UserEntity(\"1\", \"Alice\", \"a@b.com\", 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fakeApi.simulateError(NetworkError.Connectivity(IOException(\"No network\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val results = repository.observeUser(\"1\").take(1).toList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"Alice\", results[0].name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试用的 Fake 实现也放在 <code>commonTest</code> 中共享：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest&#10;class FakeUserApi : UserApi {&#10;    private var nextResponse: Result&lt;UserResponse&gt; = Result.success(&#10;        UserResponse(&quot;default&quot;, &quot;Default&quot;, &quot;d@e.com&quot;, &quot;2026-01-01&quot;)&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    fun respondWith(response: UserResponse) {&#10;        nextResponse = Result.success(response)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun simulateError(error: NetworkError) {&#10;        nextResponse = Result.failure(error)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    override suspend fun getUser(id: String): UserResponse =&#10;        nextResponse.getOrThrow()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class FakeUserApi : UserApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var nextResponse: Result&#x3C;UserResponse> = Result.success(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        UserResponse(\"default\", \"Default\", \"d@e.com\", \"2026-01-01\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun respondWith(response: UserResponse) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nextResponse = Result.success(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun simulateError(error: NetworkError) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nextResponse = Result.failure(error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override suspend fun getUser(id: String): UserResponse =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        nextResponse.getOrThrow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"协程测试\">协程测试</h2><p><code>kotlinx-coroutines-test</code> 提供 <code>runTest</code> 和 <code>TestDispatcher</code>，在 commonTest 中统一使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest&#10;class TimerServiceTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun countdown_emitsCorrectSequence() = runTest {&#10;        val timer = TimerService(testScheduler)&#10;&#10;        val emissions = mutableListOf&lt;Int&gt;()&#10;        val job = launch {&#10;            timer.countdown(from = 3).collect { emissions.add(it) }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2), emissions)&#10;        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2, 1), emissions)&#10;        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2, 1, 0), emissions)&#10;&#10;        job.cancel()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class TimerServiceTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun countdown_emitsCorrectSequence() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val timer = TimerService(testScheduler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val emissions = mutableListOf&#x3C;Int>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val job = launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            timer.countdown(from = 3).collect { emissions.add(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2), emissions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2, 1), emissions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        advanceTimeBy(1000); assertEquals(listOf(3, 2, 1, 0), emissions)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        job.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"平台特定测试\">平台特定测试</h2><p>某些测试只能在特定平台上运行（如 Android Context、iOS Keychain）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// androidTest&#10;class AndroidKeystoreTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun storeAndRetrieve_encryptsCorrectly() {&#10;        val keystore = AndroidKeystore(InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().targetContext)&#10;        keystore.store(&quot;secret&quot;, &quot;my_password_123&quot;)&#10;&#10;        val retrieved = keystore.retrieve(&quot;secret&quot;)&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;my_password_123&quot;, retrieved)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosTest&#10;class IOSKeychainTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun storeAndRetrieve_usesSecureEnclave() {&#10;        val keychain = IOSKeychain()&#10;        keychain.store(&quot;secret&quot;, &quot;my_password_123&quot;)&#10;&#10;        val retrieved = keychain.retrieve(&quot;secret&quot;)&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;my_password_123&quot;, retrieved)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// androidTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AndroidKeystoreTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun storeAndRetrieve_encryptsCorrectly() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val keystore = AndroidKeystore(InstrumentationRegistry.getInstrumentation().targetContext)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        keystore.store(\"secret\", \"my_password_123\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val retrieved = keystore.retrieve(\"secret\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"my_password_123\", retrieved)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class IOSKeychainTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun storeAndRetrieve_usesSecureEnclave() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val keychain = IOSKeychain()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        keychain.store(\"secret\", \"my_password_123\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val retrieved = keychain.retrieve(\"secret\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"my_password_123\", retrieved)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"compose-ui-测试\">Compose UI 测试</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 1.11 引入了 v2 UI 测试 API，支持所有平台：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest（或平台 test）&#10;class LoginScreenTest {&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun loginButton_disabledWhenFieldsEmpty() = runComposeUiTest {&#10;        setContent { LoginScreen(onLogin = {}) }&#10;&#10;        onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsNotEnabled()&#10;&#10;        onNodeWithText(&quot;邮箱&quot;).performTextInput(&quot;user@example.com&quot;)&#10;        onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsNotEnabled()  // 密码仍为空&#10;&#10;        onNodeWithText(&quot;密码&quot;).performTextInput(&quot;password123&quot;)&#10;        onNodeWithText(&quot;登录&quot;).assertIsEnabled()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest（或平台 test）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class LoginScreenTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loginButton_disabledWhenFieldsEmpty() = runComposeUiTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        setContent { LoginScreen(onLogin = {}) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsNotEnabled()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onNodeWithText(\"邮箱\").performTextInput(\"user@example.com\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsNotEnabled()  // 密码仍为空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onNodeWithText(\"密码\").performTextInput(\"password123\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onNodeWithText(\"登录\").assertIsEnabled()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ci-cd-流水线设计\">CI/CD 流水线设计</h2><p>一个典型的 KMP 项目 CI 流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Push / PR] --&gt; B[Lint &amp; Format Check]&#10;    B --&gt; C{并行构建}&#10;    C --&gt; D[Android Build + Unit Tests]&#10;    C --&gt; E[iOS Build + Simulator Tests]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Desktop JVM Tests]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Android Instrumented Tests]&#10;    E --&gt; H[iOS UI Tests]&#10;    G --&gt; I[合并报告]&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J{全部通过?}&#10;    J --&gt;|是| K[发布 Artifacts]&#10;    J --&gt;|否| L[通知 + Block]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Push / PR] --&gt; B[Lint &amp; Format Check]\n    B --&gt; C{并行构建}\n    C --&gt; D[Android Build + Unit Tests]\n    C --&gt; E[iOS Build + Simulator Tests]\n    C --&gt; F[Desktop JVM Tests]\n    D --&gt; G[Android Instrumented Tests]\n    E --&gt; H[iOS UI Tests]\n    G --&gt; I[合并报告]\n    H --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J{全部通过?}\n    J --&gt;|是| K[发布 Artifacts]\n    J --&gt;|否| L[通知 + Block]</pre><p>GitHub Actions 配置要点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/kmp-ci.yml&#10;jobs:&#10;  common-tests:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-java@v4&#10;        with: { java-version: &#39;17&#39;, distribution: &#39;temurin&#39; }&#10;      - run: ./gradlew :shared:jvmTest # 最快的反馈&#10;&#10;  ios-tests:&#10;    runs-on: macos-14 # Apple Silicon runner&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-java@v4&#10;        with: { java-version: &#39;17&#39;, distribution: &#39;temurin&#39; }&#10;      - run: ./gradlew :shared:iosSimulatorArm64Test&#10;      - run: xcodebuild test -workspace iosApp/iosApp.xcworkspace&#10;          -scheme iosApp -destination &#39;platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 16&#39;&#10;&#10;  android-tests:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-java@v4&#10;        with: { java-version: &#39;17&#39;, distribution: &#39;temurin&#39; }&#10;      - run: ./gradlew :shared:testDebugUnitTest&#10;      - run: ./gradlew :androidApp:connectedAndroidTest # 需 emulator\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/kmp-ci.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  common-tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-java@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">java-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'17'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">distribution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'temurin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./gradlew :shared:jvmTest</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A73